{"bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapter":{"bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第九章","chapterTitle":"第九章","chapterSlug":"ch09","sourceFile":"財務分析-第九章.pdf","questionCount":36,"questions":[{"id":"financial-analysis-ch09-pdf-0001","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第九章","chapterTitle":"第九章","number":1,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第九章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch09/page-01.webp","x":180,"y":445,"width":1040,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch09/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":548,"width":1160,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"資產負債表外負債愈多,則其盈餘品質","optionTexts":{"1":"愈高","2":"沒有影響","3":"愈低","4":"不一定"},"explanationText":"盈餘實際的波動性會較帳面上為大。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e71889a4a294dbb82cd5f5eb4cb564b5e65b2e66e87775a3a149b5e981805c83","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ccd23e9b283a5a0810902a0cdf6cef5824f986c8514f6a902e462fc6abdb5966"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch09-pdf-0002","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第九章","chapterTitle":"第九章","number":2,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第九章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch09/page-01.webp","x":174,"y":606,"width":1046,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch09/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":755,"width":1160,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列敘述何者通常為真?","optionTexts":{"1":"會計政策變動之累積影響數可預測性高","2":"其他收入的可預測性與停業單位損益一樣","3":"營業收入的可預測性較其他收入為高","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆非"},"explanationText":"愈經常性發生的科目,其可預測性是愈高的,故營業收入的可預測性大於其他收入,而會計政策變動之累積影響數可預測性低。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"185f42ae7b43104ad966436acc165e0f62388893b86427a8c02b04fa495d6b1